{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Find and grab object, check properties. If not in view, approach it. Scan area if unsuccessful. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = IsObjectInView    /> <Action ID = IsObjectInRange    /> <Action ID = MoveToGrabObject    /> <Action ID = ScanForObjects    />",
